SDL-E1025 (spec/function.md)

  x trailing `,` in the parameter list
   ,----
 1 | fn price($a: int,) { 1 };
   :                  |
   :                  `-- trailing comma
   `----
  help: remove the trailing `,`; SurrealQL accepts one but INFO never emits it, so SDL is deliberately stricter
